# Jihad Browser branding package. Copyright 2026 NotAlexNoyle. MPL-2.0 (matches the GRE it
# registers into).
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS: toolkit's about:addons (chrome/toolkit/content/mozapps/extensions/
# extensions.xul) opens with
#     <!ENTITY % brandDTD SYSTEM "chrome://branding/locale/brand.dtd" > %brandDTD;
# In Firefox/Pale Moon the `branding` package is supplied by the APPLICATION (browser/branding),
# not by the GRE. This build embeds the GRE with no application on top, and the branding strip
# (cavekit-licensing-branding.md R3) removed the vendor's, so `chrome://branding/` resolved to
# nothing. A DTD that fails to load is a hard XML parse error, so about:addons died with
#     No chrome package registered for chrome://branding/locale/brand.dtd
# before rendering anything. Registering our OWN branding package fixes it without reinstating
# any of the upstream vendor's trademarked assets.
#
# Paths are relative to THIS FILE, which is installed at the GRE root next to chrome.manifest.
content branding branding/content/
locale  branding en-US branding/locale/en-US/
